<header>
<h1>Mathematical Equations</h1>
<p class="author">latex-rs</p>
</header>
<p></p>
<h2>Algebra</h2>
<p></p>
The quadratic formula:
<math display="block"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>±</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math><div class="math display" aria-hidden="true">x = [-b ± √(b² - 4ac)] ÷ [2a]</div>
<p></p>
<h2>Calculus</h2>
<p></p>
The fundamental theorem of calculus:
<math display="block"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mspace width="0.167em" /><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></math><div class="math display" aria-hidden="true">∫ₐᵇ f(x) dx = F(b) - F(a)</div>
<p></p>
<h2>Linear Algebra</h2>
<p></p>
Matrix multiplication:
<math display="block"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><div class="math display" aria-hidden="true">[
        a   b  
        c   d
    ]
    [
        x  
        y
    ]
    =
    [
        ax + by  
        cx + dy
    ]</div>
<p></p>
</body>
